:: MP Safehouse Network Extra 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpSafehouseInit>>
暗渠的入口在码头冷库后面，平时被一排空鱼筐挡着。今夜筐被挪开了半尺，露出底下一块活动的青石。你掀开石头，一股混着铁锈和烂泥的气味涌上来，渠水在黑里反着一点碎光，水面比上个月高了不少，已经漫过第一层砖台。
<br><br>
高街那边等着接货。钟楼暗阁的暗匣要换一批东西，而码头这处多出来的两只木箱又不能久留；走街面要绕三个哨卡，走暗渠只要顺着水声一直往前，从钟楼底下的旧排水口钻出去。老妇说过，暗渠不是路，是一条会呼吸的缝：潮水涨时它往里吞，潮水退时它往外吐，人只能挑它换气的那一阵过去。
<br><br>
你把裤脚卷到膝盖，先伸一只脚试了试水温。水冷得像刀背，渠底的石板滑得站不住，头顶的砖拱低的地方要弯腰，窄的地方肩膀会蹭到墙。木箱不能沾水，得举过头顶；两只箱子，一个人搬，来回就是两趟。你也可以分几次慢慢运，每次只带一只，多跑两夜，风险小些；或者干脆从街面走，快是快，可街上的灯笼比渠里的水更认人。
<br><br>
<<if ($sneak or 0) gte 220 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>>你听得出水声在哪一段变闷，哪一段底下有暗坎；贴着墙走，脚下的石板虽滑，却不会把人带进深水。<<else>>你刚走几步就踩空了一下，膝盖磕在渠壁上，水声把响动放得很大；这样的路，走一趟可以，走两趟未必还能摸回原处。<</if>>
<br><br>
渠口的风忽然倒灌，水面浮起一层白色的沫。你退回青石边，把木箱重新捆紧；绳子勒进箱角，发出干涩的摩擦声，水面上浮着的几片碎木转了两圈，又被吸进更深的暗道里。木箱底下的水线又往上爬了一指，箱角已经开始发软；你算了算潮水换气的时辰，知道再拖下去，连渠口那块青石都会被水顶住。远处高街的钟敲了半下，声音顺着排水口落下来，闷闷的，像有人在地底数着你的脚步。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全屋账页 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 220 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>><<link [[连夜走暗渠 (0:16)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) - 4)>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) - 4)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.stash to ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 1 ? 1 : 0)>><<mpalert -3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[连夜走暗渠 (0:16)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 16>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) + 7)>><<mpalert 4>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[分批慢运 (0:20)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 20>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) - 2)>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) - 2)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep or 10) + 2>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep or 10) + 2>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -1>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[改走街面 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) + 6)>><<mpalert 5>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 1>><</link>>

:: MP Safehouse Network Extra 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpSafehouseInit>>
高街钟楼对面的巷子里新搬来一户人家。女人带着一个半大的孩子，白天在门口支一张矮凳择菜，眼睛却总往钟楼那边瞟。你从侧巷进出第三次时，她终于开口了，问你是不是在钟楼里做事，问修钟匠是不是还住在塔上，问塔上那间小屋夜里亮不亮灯。
<br><br>
她的问题都不重，一句一句地落下来，像往秤盘上加石子。你答得太顺，她会记住你的脸；你一句不答，她又会去问隔壁的店主。钟楼暗阁的优势本来就在高处和安静，可这份安静如今多了一双眼睛盯着；那户人家的窗正对铁梯，黄昏时屋里不开灯，人影却映在窗帘上。
<br><br>
老妇听说后，给你出了三个主意。请她进屋喝一碗茶，把话头摊开，能换来一时的安稳，但要搭上茶叶和几句好听话；趁夜把她家门口的记号挪走，让她分不清你从哪一边进塔，这需要手脚干净；再不然，就索性请她替你看门，给她一份常年的补贴，让她替你留意巷口的生人。
<br><br>
<<if ($charm or 0) gte 200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200>>你懂得怎么把话说到对方心里去，也知道主妇最在意的是孩子和米价；一碗热茶配几句实在话，比堵她的嘴更有用。<<else>>你站在门口，话到嘴边又觉得生硬；这样的邻居不是哄一句就能打发的，答得不好，反倒让她更想弄清楚钟楼里住了谁。<</if>>
<br><br>
孩子蹲在矮凳旁边玩一枚磨旧的铜扣，抬头看了你一眼，又低头继续玩。女人忽然说，她男人去年也是夜里出门做事，后来就没再回来，只在门口留下这枚铜扣。她把话说得很轻，像在说邻家的旧闻，眼睛却没有离开你的脸。她把择好的菜拢进篮子，没有催你回答，只是把择下来的黄叶一片片收进手心。巷口的风把篮底一片黄叶吹到铁梯脚下，她也没有去捡。凳子往门里挪了挪，给你让出一条能走的道。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全屋账页 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($charm or 0) gte 200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200>><<link [[请她进屋喝茶 (0:12)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) - 5)>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep or 10) + 3>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[请她进屋喝茶 (0:12)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) + 5)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 200 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>><<link [[半夜挪走标记 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) - 7)>><<mpalert -2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[半夜挪走标记 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) + 3)>><<mpalert 5>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[请她替你看门 (0:14)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 20) - 10)>><<set $mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.upkeep or 10) + 6>><<mpalert -2>><<stress 1>><</link>>

:: MP Safehouse Network Extra 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpSafehouseInit>>
雾潮来的时候没有雷，只有水。先是码头栈桥下的水声变了调，接着冷库后面的暗渠开始往上冒泡，最后连四号仓库的门槛都渗出一线发亮的湿痕。你赶到时，靠水那处窝的最低一层已经积了半尺水，腌鱼桶浮起来又撞在墙上，发出空洞的响声。
<br><br>
暗匣就在最低那格砖台上，水已经漫到匣底。再往上涨一点，匣子里的干布和纸就会被泡透。林间树屋那边也未必好过，绳桥低处的木板肯定已泡在水里，炉子和柴堆若没垫高，这一夜就白搭。雾潮不看人的账本，它只按水尺办事；你能做的，是在它漫过某一格之前，把那一格的东西搬走，或者把水引去别处。
<br><br>
引水需要懂暗渠的走向，知道哪块闸板还能扳动，哪一段旧沟没有被砖头堵死；搬东西则靠腿脚和力气，来回几趟，把能救的先救出来。还有一条最省事也最心疼的路：放弃靠水的最低一层，把上面封好，让水自己灌满下面，地方小了，往后要守的东西也少了。
<br><br>
<<if ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 3>>水尺已经高过往常许多，渠口的铁栅被水推得嗡嗡作响；这一夜不是修修补补的天气，能抢回多少算多少。<<elseif ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 1>>水涨得比预想快，但还没到封路的地步；只要动作利落，低处的东西大多来得及搬。<<else>>雾潮比账上记的温和，水线停在砖台下面，你还有工夫挑一挑先救哪一样。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 200>>你踩进水里，脚下虽滑，重心却压得住；一匣一匣往外递，比整箱硬拖要稳，也不会把匣底的木板泡散。<<else>>水比看上去更急，你刚弯腰去够暗匣，脚底就被冲得偏了半步；这样的水势，硬搬容易连人带匣一起滑进渠里。<</if>>
<br><br>
仓库外传来有人涉水跑过的声音，随即又远了。你把暗匣的提手攥在手里，木柄被水泡得发滑；袖子往上又卷了一圈，你盯着那格还在水面下的砖台。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全屋账页 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 200>><<link [[抢搬低处暗匣 (0:14)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) - 4)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.stash to ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 1 ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep or 10) + 2>><<tiredness 3>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[抢搬低处暗匣 (0:14)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 14>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.stash to 0>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) + 6)>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 220 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>><<link [[开闸放水 (0:12)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) - 5)>><<set $mpSafehouses.forest.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.forest.risk or 20) - 3)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep or 10) + 4>><<set $mpSafehouses.forest.upkeep to ($mpSafehouses.forest.upkeep or 10) + 3>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><<link [[开闸放水 (0:12)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) + 5)>><<set $mpSafehouses.forest.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.forest.risk or 20) + 5)>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<if ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier or 0) gte 1>><<link [[弃低处保高处 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.tier to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier or 0) - 1)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.bed to ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 1 ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.stash to 0>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.bench to ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 2 ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.beacon to ($mpSafehouses.docks.tier gte 3 ? 1 : 0)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep to $mpSafehouses.docks.tier * 15>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) - 4)>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[弃低处保高处 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.risk to Math.min(50, ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 20) + 4)>><<set $mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep to Math.max(5, ($mpSafehouses.docks.upkeep or 10) - 2)>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Safehouse Network Extra Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpSafehouseInit>>
<<set _openCount to ($mpSafehouses.docks.unlocked or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.unlocked or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.temple.unlocked or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.unlocked or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.forest.unlocked or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.school.unlocked or 0)>>
<<set _riskSum to ($mpSafehouses.docks.risk or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.orphanage.risk or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.temple.risk or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.highstreet.risk or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.forest.risk or 0) + ($mpSafehouses.school.risk or 0)>>
<<set _highTier to (($mpSafehouses.docks.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0) + (($mpSafehouses.orphanage.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0) + (($mpSafehouses.temple.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0) + (($mpSafehouses.highstreet.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0) + (($mpSafehouses.forest.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0) + (($mpSafehouses.school.tier or 0) gte 2 ? 1 : 0)>>
老妇把六张纸重新叠好，压回账册里，只留下最后一页空白。她说这一页不记开销，只记定局；定局一落笔，往后六处窝就照这个法子过下去，改起来要花双倍的工夫。灯芯挑高了，纸面被照得发白，边角的水痕像一圈旧地图。
<br><br>
她把笔搁在你面前，笔尖上还沾着上一页没有干透的墨。六处窝的账已经翻到最后一页，能落脚的地方、还能撑多久的墙、谁家的灯夜里亮着，全在纸上摆着，只差一个字。她说字不能乱写：写贯通，往后走的是地底下的路，省时也省脚力，可一条路通了，六处就成了一条绳上的结；写加固，往后守的是各自的墙，门厚了，路却还是地面上的老路。
<br><br>
<<if _openCount is 0>>账上还没有一处真正能住人的窝。老妇说这时候落笔最轻，也最没意思：没有路可通，也没有墙可加，只能把几处空壳的门从里头钉死，记一笔「加固」，等哪天有人再回来把钉子起出来。<<elseif _openCount lte 2 and _highTier is 0>>能用的窝太少，彼此离得也远，硬要把它们串成一条暗路，中间得穿过太多别人的地界。她劝你只在已经能住人的那几处上做文章，墙虽不多，至少守得住。<<else>>账上的窝已经够多，彼此的距离也不再是问题。老妇用指尖在纸面上虚划了一条线，从靠水的那处一直连到高处，说这条线画不画，只在你一念之间。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpSafehouses.outcome is "linked">>定局栏里已经写着「暗道贯通」。六处窝被窄道接了起来，夜里的路比白天短，巡夜的岗哨往往要迟一步才察觉；再落一次笔，只会把已经接好的线搅乱。<<elseif $mpSafehouses.outcome is "fortified">>定局栏里已经写着「重装加固」。六处窝各守各的门，墙比路更可靠，代价是每一趟往来都得贴着街面绕远；再落一次笔，只会把已经钉死的板子再撬开。<<else>>定局栏还空着，像账页末尾那道等人落笔的横线，墨迹在灯下泛着一点湿光。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpSafehouses.outcome is "linked">><<getouticon>><<link [[返回安全屋账页 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<elseif $mpSafehouses.outcome is "fortified">><<link [[返回安全屋账页 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<elseif _openCount gte 4 and _riskSum lte 110>><<walkicon>><<link [[定为暗道贯通 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.outcome to "linked">><<for _loc range ["docks", "orphanage", "temple", "highstreet", "forest", "school"]>><<if $mpSafehouses[_loc].unlocked>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses[_loc].risk or 20) - 3)>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep to ($mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep or 10) + 2>><</if>><</for>><<mpalert -6>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<elseif _highTier gte 1>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[定为重装加固 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.outcome to "fortified">><<for _loc range ["docks", "orphanage", "temple", "highstreet", "forest", "school"]>><<if $mpSafehouses[_loc].unlocked and ($mpSafehouses[_loc].tier or 0) gte 1>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses[_loc].risk or 20) - 5)>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep to ($mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep or 10) + 4>><</if>><</for>><<mpalert -3>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<else>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[封账暂守成 (0:10)|MP Safehouse Network More Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpSafehouses.outcome to "fortified">><<for _loc range ["docks", "orphanage", "temple", "highstreet", "forest", "school"]>><<if $mpSafehouses[_loc].unlocked>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].risk to Math.max(0, ($mpSafehouses[_loc].risk or 20) - 2)>><<set $mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep to Math.max(5, ($mpSafehouses[_loc].upkeep or 10) - 2)>><</if>><</for>><<mpalert -2>><<stress -1>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[返回安全屋总枢 (0:02)|MP Safehouse Network Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
